// Cloudshift — "Exile target creature you control, then return that card to
// the battlefield under your control." Hand-written: the "under your
// control" phrasing isn't parsed by the extraction pipeline yet
// (plugins/wizards/cards/Cloudshift.ron.todo carries it Unparsed) — see
// docs/decisions/card-data.md's hand-written-entries policy. Exercises
// `EnterRider::UnderControlOf(You)` ([CR#110.2a]): unlike
// `UnderOwnersControl` (Otherworldly Journey), "your control" names a
// SPECIFIC player rather than defaulting to the owner — the only real card
// in this canon slice covering that grammar node
// (`no_dead_grammar.rs`'s `EnterRider::UnderControlOf` entry).
Normal(
  name: "Cloudshift",
  mana_cost: [
    White,
  ],
  types: [
    Instant,
  ],
  abilities: [
    Spell(
      effect: Targeted(
        targets: [TargetOne(And([Creature, ControlledBy(Ref(You))]))],
        effect: Sequentially([
          Move(Target(0), Exile),
          Move(That(Card), Battlefield, [
            UnderControlOf(You),
          ]),
        ]),
      ),
    ),
  ],
)
